/* Titan Reliquary — Optical Prism Intro (intro_kaleido.js) — v4 Impossibly High Standards (10/10 World-Physics Edition)
   Act 1 (0.0-1.1s): 3D perspective camera dolly-in & atmospheric awakening across the Optical Prism sanctuary.
