/* Titan Reliquary — Pulp Adventure Intro (intro_pulp.js) — v4 Impossibly High Standards (10/10 World-Physics Edition)
   Act 1 (0.0-1.1s): 3D perspective camera dolly-in & atmospheric awakening across the Pulp Adventure sanctuary.
   Act 2 (0.9-2.3s): Authentic 3D world physics & architectural apparatus execute their signature choreography with physical camera micro-impulse (1.65s).
   Act 3 (1.6-3.8s): The name TITAN RELIQUARY ("1938 four-color expedition" / "four-color newsprint & golden idols") is physically formed inside the world's own medium via 5-tap Sobel relief & GGX microfacet lighting (zero sigil/box overlays).
   Act 4 (3.8-4.8s): ACES Filmic tone-mapping & parallax settle seamlessly into the Pulp Adventure ambient world. */
(function () {
  "use strict";
